# start-docked.drv - intro -> start-position menu -> docked at Lave Station.
#
# Verifies: FI-05 (intro runs), FI-06 (Space opens the start-position menu),
#           FI-21 (2D cockpit and control panel while docked).
# Acceptance: (b) a run reaches a docked view inside the timeout and exits 0;
#             (c) two runs give the same screens (drive.py --compare).
# Run:  python3 tools/drive/drive.py --script tools/drive/scripts/start-docked.drv \
#           --out RUN_DIR --timeout 60
# Expect: exit 0, three shots: 01-intro, 02-start-menu, 03-docked.
# Timing is approximate (host clock on a second thread); the waits leave slack.

wait 6000         # the intro is running
shot 01-intro
key space         # ST Space leaves the intro
wait 2000
shot 02-start-menu
key 3             # start position 3: Lave Station, docked
wait 11000        # the core loads the start position and draws the station
shot 03-docked
quit              # SDL_QUIT: Main_EventHandler exits 0
